{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T05:54:00.816Z","ordinal":82513,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a114e8-3dc1-7553-b4e3-fbed0e137776","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-06ae29eb-71c4-4313-8253-53eb2bb168fb","process_id":"78626","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","/opt/homebrew/bin/gh api 'repos/iqb-berlin/testcenter/compare/c35cff81383949b4664e0fdffa3ba1154d144d9d...a570587f12e10989f80e91a3d559aa5f753ec3f0' --jq '{status,ahead_by,commits:[.commits[]|{sha,message:.commit.message}],files:[.files[]|{filename,status,additions,deletions}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"/opt/homebrew/bin/gh api 'repos/iqb-berlin/testcenter/compare/c35cff81383949b4664e0fdffa3ba1154d144d9d...a570587f12e10989f80e91a3d559aa5f753ec3f0' --jq '{status,ahead_by,commits:[.commits[]|{sha,message:.commit.message}],files:[.files[]|{filename,status,additions,deletions}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n{\"ahead_by\":12,\"commits\":[{\"message\":\"[fe] All login buttons stay disabled as long is ALTCHA check is running\\n\\nPrevents multiple login attempts\",\"sha\":\"8122ee3459f4716a21be382073469b39a5174e02\"},{\"message\":\"Merge pull request #1612 from iqb-berlin/disable-while-load\\n\\n[fe] All login buttons stay disabled as long is ALTCHA check is running\",\"sha\":\"8fd6a657870882be3c9c21baf8e41929faafb841\"},{\"message\":\"[docs] Update release process\",\"sha\":\"471f968860223b3cbe205587e7abe7ebcbd83ce7\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Remove unused make targets\\n\\n- prod-test-*: an unused prototype for running locally built production\\n  images. They read DOCKER_HUB_PROXY instead of DOCKERHUB_PROXY, rewrote\\n  VERSION in .env.prod in place and built an e2e image nothing ran.\\n- push-dockerhub, push-iqb-registry: CI builds and pushes all images.\\n- test-frontend-integration: an empty placeholder.\\n- the include of the git-ignored testcenter-scripts/makefile-plus.mk.\",\"sha\":\"662b985a58fac316e551734cd295f081b39a52e3\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Stop the update when the user declines to continue after the backup\\n\\nThe backup phase runs as a child process of update.sh and exited 0 when\\nthe user declined to continue after a failed backup or skipped migration\\nscripts, so update.sh went on with the apply phase. It now exits with a\\ndedicated code that update.sh treats as a clean stop.\\n\\nupdate.sh no longer uses set -e: it checks every step that can fail\\nitself, and set -e only ended it before it could check a phase's exit\\ncode and remove the downloaded updater.\",\"sha\":\"09baf98ea02636b1cb8bb303f499b23b1e1e21ee\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Stop listing every file during backup and restore\\n\\nThe backend data archive was created and extracted with tar's verbose\\nflag, which printed each file of the data volume. The archive is now\\ncreated relative to /, so busybox no longer warns about stripping the\\nleading slash; the archive layout is unchanged.\",\"sha\":\"f2d8e5753ff318f66538d8d53d1bd01ebaebc52c\"},{\"message\":\"[fe] Unify brute-force-protected login flows in one service\",\"sha\":\"184a34a5a74ad45c1f1bef3ed42900b465f4b1ed\"},{\"message\":\"[fe] Show a notice when brute force protection is used without HTTPS\\n\\n#1595\",\"sha\":\"bb7056f92e59790deaee036291b0e278a9831383\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Disable brute force protection by default for new installations\",\"sha\":\"b704b187d8410abc0abb10242f7578adce3bf10c\"},{\"message\":\"Rework ESLint setup\\n\\nMove to ESLint 10 with a flat config in eslint.config.mjs, replacing\\n@iqb/eslint-config and its airbnb base. Rules now come from the\\nESLint and typescript-eslint (type-checked) recommended presets,\\n@stylistic for formatting and eslint-plugin-cypress for the e2e tests.\\n`npm run lint` covers all JS/TS files in the repository, skipping what\\n.gitignore excludes.\",\"sha\":\"6cd39575e7c99ccc7340f948bf912e0a5cd810ac\"},{\"message\":\"[be] Remove calls to methods that no longer exist\\n\\n- TestDAOTest: drop TestDAOExposed, which wrapped a parent method\\nTestDAO\\n  no longer has; nothing called it.\\n- massive-test-data.php: create tests with TestDAO::createTest instead\\nof\\n  getOrCreateTest, which was removed in 2023, and drop the unused\\n  method_exists fallback for createPersonSession.\\n- TestDAOTest: drop the \\\"same partid\\\" step of test_updateDataParts; its\\n  duplicate array key made it repeat the previous step.\\n- massive-test-data.md: drop the reference to a deleted example script.\\n\\n#1609\",\"sha\":\"1dd4f9b6aac125db678f81a6bbc47a3305f2132b\"},{\"message\":\"[ai] Add commit message rules to AGENTS.md\\n\\nAdd the [ai] tag for agent instructions and config, require commit\\nmessage bodies to wrap at 72 characters and forbid GitHub closing\\nkeywords when referencing issues.\",\"sha\":\"a570587f12e10989f80e91a3d559aa5f753ec3f0\"}],\"files\":[{\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\".env.prod-template\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":3,\"filename\":\".eslintignore\",\"status\":\"removed\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":3,\"filename\":\".gitignore\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"AGENTS.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":21,\"filename\":\"Makefile\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":5,\"filename\":\"backend/test/massive-test-data.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":7,\"deletions\":14,\"filename\":\"backend/test/massive-test-data.php\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":30,\"filename\":\"backend/test/unit/dao/TestDAOTest.php\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":10,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"docs/CHANGELOG.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":73,\"deletions\":20,\"filename\":\"docs/release_process.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"docs/style-guide.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":91,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"eslint.config.mjs\",\"status\":\"added\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":2,\"filename\":\"frontend/package.json\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":25,\"deletions\":56,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/code-login/code-login.component.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/login/admin-login/admin-login.component.html\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":22,\"deletions\":53,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/login/admin-login/admin-login.component.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/login/login.component.html\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":21,\"deletions\":52,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/login/login.component.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":8,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app.interfaces.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":15,\"deletions\":7,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/backend.service.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":75,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/brute-force-protection.service.ts\",\"status\":\"added\"},{\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/shared/components/code-input/code-input.component.html\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/shared/components/code-input/text-field-form.component.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":709,\"deletions\":2568,\"filename\":\"package-lock.json\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":8,\"deletions\":63,\"filename\":\"package.json\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"scripts/helm/testcenter/values.yaml\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":4,\"filename\":\"scripts/make/dev-test.mk\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":110,\"filename\":\"scripts/make/prod-test.mk\",\"status\":\"removed\"},{\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":2,\"filename\":\"scripts/make/prod.mk\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":63,\"filename\":\"scripts/make/push.mk\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":8,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"scripts/update.sh\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":6,\"deletions\":2,\"filename\":\"scripts/updater.sh\",\"status\":\"modified\"}],\"status\":\"ahead\"}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n{\"ahead_by\":12,\"commits\":[{\"message\":\"[fe] All login buttons stay disabled as long is ALTCHA check is running\\n\\nPrevents multiple login attempts\",\"sha\":\"8122ee3459f4716a21be382073469b39a5174e02\"},{\"message\":\"Merge pull request #1612 from iqb-berlin/disable-while-load\\n\\n[fe] All login buttons stay disabled as long is ALTCHA check is running\",\"sha\":\"8fd6a657870882be3c9c21baf8e41929faafb841\"},{\"message\":\"[docs] Update release process\",\"sha\":\"471f968860223b3cbe205587e7abe7ebcbd83ce7\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Remove unused make targets\\n\\n- prod-test-*: an unused prototype for running locally built production\\n  images. They read DOCKER_HUB_PROXY instead of DOCKERHUB_PROXY, rewrote\\n  VERSION in .env.prod in place and built an e2e image nothing ran.\\n- push-dockerhub, push-iqb-registry: CI builds and pushes all images.\\n- test-frontend-integration: an empty placeholder.\\n- the include of the git-ignored testcenter-scripts/makefile-plus.mk.\",\"sha\":\"662b985a58fac316e551734cd295f081b39a52e3\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Stop the update when the user declines to continue after the backup\\n\\nThe backup phase runs as a child process of update.sh and exited 0 when\\nthe user declined to continue after a failed backup or skipped migration\\nscripts, so update.sh went on with the apply phase. It now exits with a\\ndedicated code that update.sh treats as a clean stop.\\n\\nupdate.sh no longer uses set -e: it checks every step that can fail\\nitself, and set -e only ended it before it could check a phase's exit\\ncode and remove the downloaded updater.\",\"sha\":\"09baf98ea02636b1cb8bb303f499b23b1e1e21ee\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Stop listing every file during backup and restore\\n\\nThe backend data archive was created and extracted with tar's verbose\\nflag, which printed each file of the data volume. The archive is now\\ncreated relative to /, so busybox no longer warns about stripping the\\nleading slash; the archive layout is unchanged.\",\"sha\":\"f2d8e5753ff318f66538d8d53d1bd01ebaebc52c\"},{\"message\":\"[fe] Unify brute-force-protected login flows in one service\",\"sha\":\"184a34a5a74ad45c1f1bef3ed42900b465f4b1ed\"},{\"message\":\"[fe] Show a notice when brute force protection is used without HTTPS\\n\\n#1595\",\"sha\":\"bb7056f92e59790deaee036291b0e278a9831383\"},{\"message\":\"[infra] Disable brute force protection by default for new installations\",\"sha\":\"b704b187d8410abc0abb10242f7578adce3bf10c\"},{\"message\":\"Rework ESLint setup\\n\\nMove to ESLint 10 with a flat config in eslint.config.mjs, replacing\\n@iqb/eslint-config and its airbnb base. Rules now come from the\\nESLint and typescript-eslint (type-checked) recommended presets,\\n@stylistic for formatting and eslint-plugin-cypress for the e2e tests.\\n`npm run lint` covers all JS/TS files in the repository, skipping what\\n.gitignore excludes.\",\"sha\":\"6cd39575e7c99ccc7340f948bf912e0a5cd810ac\"},{\"message\":\"[be] Remove calls to methods that no longer exist\\n\\n- TestDAOTest: drop TestDAOExposed, which wrapped a parent method\\nTestDAO\\n  no longer has; nothing called it.\\n- massive-test-data.php: create tests with TestDAO::createTest instead\\nof\\n  getOrCreateTest, which was removed in 2023, and drop the unused\\n  method_exists fallback for createPersonSession.\\n- TestDAOTest: drop the \\\"same partid\\\" step of test_updateDataParts; its\\n  duplicate array key made it repeat the previous step.\\n- massive-test-data.md: drop the reference to a deleted example script.\\n\\n#1609\",\"sha\":\"1dd4f9b6aac125db678f81a6bbc47a3305f2132b\"},{\"message\":\"[ai] Add commit message rules to AGENTS.md\\n\\nAdd the [ai] tag for agent instructions and config, require commit\\nmessage bodies to wrap at 72 characters and forbid GitHub closing\\nkeywords when referencing issues.\",\"sha\":\"a570587f12e10989f80e91a3d559aa5f753ec3f0\"}],\"files\":[{\"additions\":5,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\".env.prod-template\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":3,\"filename\":\".eslintignore\",\"status\":\"removed\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":3,\"filename\":\".gitignore\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":3,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"AGENTS.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":21,\"filename\":\"Makefile\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":5,\"filename\":\"backend/test/massive-test-data.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":7,\"deletions\":14,\"filename\":\"backend/test/massive-test-data.php\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":2,\"deletions\":30,\"filename\":\"backend/test/unit/dao/TestDAOTest.php\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":10,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"docs/CHANGELOG.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":73,\"deletions\":20,\"filename\":\"docs/release_process.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":1,\"filename\":\"docs/style-guide.md\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":91,\"deletions\":0,\"filename\":\"eslint.config.mjs\",\"status\":\"added\"},{\"additions\":1,\"deletions\":2,\"filename\":\"frontend/package.json\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":25,\"deletions\":56,\"filename\":\"frontend/src/app/app-root/code-login/code-login.component.ts\",\"status\":\"modified\"},{\"additions\":4,\"deletions\":1,\"filena