{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:19:55.447Z","ordinal":82860,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11504-c0b7-7702-bae2-ab31c8addd9a","call_id":"call_d1d5b7c20be2425ebc49d9334f1ffd7f","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"i\":0,\"chunk_id\":\"90cc33\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007417,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1602,\"output\":\"255-- Do not infer a full manual-coder training guide from schema documentation; preserve limitations such as non-final naming conventions and experimental reasoning-task procedure. If browser opening fails, cross-check a URL with `curl` before calling it unavailable. [Task 1]\\n256-\\n257-# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite Original parity and durable participant presence\\n258-\\n259-scope: Continue bounded Original-compatible login, participant Review export, and connection-presence work in the rewrite without treating incomplete API wiring as production-ready.\\n260:applies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app; reuse_rule=verify current branch, CI, protected PPTX, and all build/integration/browser checks before a delivery claim.\\n261-\\n262-## Task 1: Original administrator login, participant CSV, and presence tracking\\n263-\\n264-### rollout_summary_files\\n265-\\n266:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T17-47-44-rcM2-participant_run_selection_and_live_update_isolation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T19-47-44-01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T07:51:13+00:00, thread_id=01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a, partial; Review CSV remains open; selected-run isolation published but CI failing)\\n267-\\n268-### keywords\\n269-\\n270-- ReviewDAO::getReviewsByPerson, ReviewCSVFormatter, HTTP 204, original-admin-login, participant_connection_presence, SSE, 60-second leases, node --test scripts/participant-presence.test.mjs\\n271-\\n272-## Task 2: Bind participant state and live updates to the selected test run\\n273-\\n274-### rollout_summary_files\\n275-\\n276:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T17-47-44-rcM2-participant_run_selection_and_live_update_isolation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T19-47-44-01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T07:51:13+00:00, thread_id=01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a, partial; commit 5e42a17 published, PR #1 CI failed)\\n277-\\n278-### keywords\\n279-\\n280:- testRunId, getCurrentRunState, participant-event-stream, withSelectedParticipantRun, stale generation, test_run_not_found, PR-1, 5e42a17\\n281-\\n282-## User preferences\\n283-\\n284-- for autonomous parity work, preserve `docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx`, make meaningful checkpoints, and do not push unless separately authorized. [Task 1]\\n285-- participant isolation means server-side authorization derived from the authenticated participant/session, not client workspace filters. [Task 1][Task 2]\\n--\\n292-\\n293-## Failures and how to do differently\\n294-\\n295-- Do not claim the participant CSV or presence feature complete until its route/Starter UI and final stream/acknowledgement wiring pass typecheck, build, integration, and browser tests. Guard against stale/duplicate leases on stream close or run switch; polling must not overwrite live WebSocket mode. [Task 1]\\n296-- A queued/running remote CI and local browser/API checks are distinct proof. The previous push violated an earlier no-push instruction; require explicit current authorization. [Task 1]\\n297:- Commit `5e42a17` passed extensive local memory/file/SQLite, typecheck, build, browser, and presence smoke checks, but PR #1 had 19 passing and 16 failing CI checks including participant-monitor reconnect. Diagnose and rerun CI before merge; the missing participant Review CSV is a separate vertical slice. [Task 2]\\n298-\\n299-# Task Group: Keycloak HU-Shibboleth SAML reconnection review\\n300-\\n301-scope: Plan and critically review a Keycloak SAML broker reconnection to HU Shibboleth with trust, identity-link, attribute, and rollback safeguards.\\n302-applies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-05-20/wir-m-chten-unsere-keycloak-intanzen; reuse_rule=recheck HU metadata, Keycloak version/configuration, identity inventory, and HU agreements before changing production federation.\\n--\\n2797-- XML patching must handle self-closing empty cells (`V9` broke the first regex). A missing `fitz` module prevented that PDF path; LibreOffice PDF plus `pdftoppm` still supplied a visual check. [Task 1]\\n2798-\\n2799-# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV parity and optional Original login\\n2800-\\n2801-scope: Continue Original-compatible participant Review CSV work and reversible Original login parity without overstating incomplete vertical slices or full UI parity.\\n2802:applies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app; reuse_rule=reuse source paths and local build/smoke guidance in this checkout; current branch, CI, protected artifact, and parity status need fresh verification.\\n2803-\\n2804-## Task 1: Participant-isolated “Reviews downloaden” CSV parity\\n2805-\\n2806-### rollout_summary_files\\n2807-\\n2808:- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T17-47-44-rcM2-participant_run_selection_and_live_update_isolation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T19-47-44-01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T07:51:13+00:00, thread_id=01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a, partial; participant export unfinished)\\n2809-\\n2810-### keywords\\n2811-\\n2812-- participant-review-csv, GET /reviews/export, Revi