{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:45:13.369Z","ordinal":83435,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5ea72322c8191879860fdefe2b6e7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ca5c46a0347246d2b3369424e9f2ea7d","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /tmp/playwright-test-entry-target.js\\n@@\\n-      await page.locator('#generateEntryLinksButton').click();\\n+      await page.locator('#loadParticipantRosterButton').click();\\n+      await page.locator('#generateSavedRosterEntryLinksButton').click();\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:76243,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"TEST_GENERATED_ENTRY=true TARGET_FRONTEND_ROOT=/tmp/testcenter-selected-request-production-20261007.Xr9BLp TEST_BROWSER_CHANNEL=chrome node run.js /tmp/playwright-test-entry-target.js > /tmp/testcenter-entry-link-generated-browser-third-20261007.log 2>&1\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/.agents/skills/playwright\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n complete SQLite flow is being repeated. The separate immutable Memory/headful\\n@@\\n Original-UI acceptance remain independent proof.\\n+The second full SQLite run passes the unchanged Player geometry invariant and\\n+reaches the generated popup, then fails a newly added test-only assumption that\\n+`ParticipantSession` exposes scope keys. Its actual contract exposes internal\\n+IDs; the gate now checks those IDs against the authenticated Workspace overview.\\n+That failed attempt is retained and is not application-regression evidence.\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","create_time":1791355506.2766988}}}
