{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:49:31.489Z","ordinal":83516,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb78e1bc819192da5e47e2bfd2ce","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Die Zusatzprüfung besteht jetzt in beiden Oberflächen: Der generierte Einstieg startet den richtigen Teilnehmer, der Operator-Link enthält exakt dieselbe Session- und Run-ID, und die vorherige Antwort bleibt erhalten. Die alte Push-CI ist mit 21 erfolgreichen und 14 fehlgeschlagenen Jobs beendet — alle 14 scheitern am korrigierten Linkvergleich. Ich committe diesen abgesicherten Schritt mit einem frischen Entire-Checkpoint.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791355768897,"completed_at_ms":1791355771489}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:49:31.493Z","ordinal":83517,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb78e1bc819192da5e47e2bfd2ce","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"Die Zusatzprüfung besteht jetzt in beiden Oberflächen: Der generierte Einstieg startet den richtigen Teilnehmer, der Operator-Link enthält exakt dieselbe Session- und Run-ID, und die vorherige Antwort bleibt erhalten. Die alte Push-CI ist mit 21 erfolgreichen und 14 fehlgeschlagenen Jobs beendet — alle 14 scheitern am korrigierten Linkvergleich. Ich committe diesen abgesicherten Schritt mit einem frischen Entire-Checkpoint.\n"}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","create_time":1791355742.968254,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb78e1bc819192da5e47e2bfd2ce","turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1151f-da65-73f1-b602-0c40d8bfd260","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":323}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:49:44.346Z","ordinal":83518,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb7b7d7881918d4047f5641e2ef9","status":"completed","call_id":"call_lCQFOVq2xwEwMIsKpWwMmzXa","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n-fourteen later push-CI jobs fail at the same operator session-card assertion\\n+its completed push CI has 21 successful and fourteen failed jobs. All fourteen\\n+fail at the same operator session-card assertion\\n@@\\n That failed attempt is retained and is not application-regression evidence.\\n+A focused protected SQLite/headful check then passes the actual operator\\n+handoff in both interfaces: load the saved roster, generate its links, use the\\n+new login's link, open its real popup, compare the authenticated scope/Run and\\n+refresh the operator session card. Both surfaces expose the same exact\\n+Run-bound re-entry URL and retain the older Run's exact answer and status.\\n Evidence is retained in ignored `.data/entry-link-scope-20261007.*`.\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\n@@\\n close any full rendered-UI acceptance row or pixel-identity claim.\\n+\\n+The 2026-10-07 operator handoff check also passes in both interface modes on\\n+owned protected SQLite/headful Chrome: a generated entry starts the requested\\n+login and its exact authenticated Run, and the refreshed operator card exposes\\n+the same Run-bound re-entry URL. The older participant's response and Run status\\n+remain unchanged. Shared browser gates now check that durable identity instead\\n+of racing login inputs removed after success, and retain the same full-height\\n+Player invariant after layout settling. This closes no full UI row. The separate\\n+immutable Memory/headful Chrome ItemBuilder blank-frame failure remains open;\\n+see `PARITY.md` for the retained evidence and publication boundaries.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cp /tmp/testcenter-entry-link-generated-browser-fifth-20261007.log /tmp/playwright-test-entry-target.js .data/entry-link-scope-20261007.yQtOOZ/\\ngit diff --check\\ngit diff --stat\\nnode --check scripts/smoke-ui.mjs\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",max_output_tokens:1500}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:32841,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git add rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-ui.mjs rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\ngit commit -m \\\"Verify generated participant entry and run-bound session links\\\"\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","create_time":1791355742.968254}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-07T06:49:44.361Z","ordinal":83519,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a","turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-162b0bff-fec7-4d01-ba48-46d533c41254","changes":{"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -43,2 +43,12 @@\n \n+The 2026-10-07 operator handoff check also passes in both interface modes on\n+owned protected SQLite/headful Chrome: a generated entry starts the requested\n+login and its exact authenticated Run, and the refreshed operator card exposes\n+the same Run-bound re-entry URL. The older participant's response and Run status\n+remain unchanged. Shared browser gates now check that durable identity instead\n+of racing login inputs removed after success, and retain the same full-height\n+Player invariant after layout settling. This closes no full UI row. The separate\n+immutable Memory/headful Chrome ItemBuilder blank-frame failure remains open;\n+see `PARITY.md` for the retained evidence and publication boundaries.\n+\n The shared backend now permits exact preset-assignment resumption after returning\n","move_path":null},"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -5,3 +5,4 @@\n The `a88f166f` publication passes the selected-Run monitor reconnect gate, but\n-fourteen later push-CI jobs fail at the same operator session-card assertion\n+its completed push CI has 21 successful and fourteen failed jobs. All fourteen\n+fail at the same operator session-card assertion\n (`smoke-ui.mjs:21293`), including PostgreSQL UI. That assertion still expects\n@@ -44,2 +45,7 @@\n That failed attempt is retained and is not application-regression evidence.\n+A focused protected SQLite/headful check then passes the actual operator\n+handoff in both interfaces: load the saved roster, generate its links, use the\n+new login's link, open its real popup, compare the authenticated scope/Run and\n+refresh the operator session card. Both surfaces expose the same exact\n+Run-bound re-entry URL and retain the older Run's exact answer and status.\n Evidence is retained in ignored `.data/entry-link-scope-20261007.*`.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\nM /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1791355784357,"completed_at_ms":1791355784361}}
