ptured\\\\n\\\\nInspect every requested participant attachment by group, login, test, unit, and variable. Camera capture is available for the original capture-image format; other imported formats remain visible without pretending to offer an unsupported workflow.\\\\n\\\\nLoad Attachments\\\\nDownload capture QR pages\\\\nQR page label template\\\\n\\\\nPlaceholders: %GROUP%, %TESTTAKER%, %BOOKLET%, %UNIT%, %VAR%, %LOGIN%, %CODE%\\\\n\\\\nLoad the workspace attachment inventory to begin.\\\\n\\\\nNo requested attachments are loaded for this workspace.\\\\n\\\\nParticipant Runtime\\\\nLogin Key\\\\nParticipant Name\\\\nPassword\\\\nParticipant Code\\\\nGroup Key\\\\nBooklet Key\\\\nSession Id\\\\nTest Run Id\\\\nCurrent Unit Key\\\\nMonitor Target Unit\\\\nMonitor Timer Seconds\\\\nReview Id\\\\nReviewer Id\\\\nReview Category\\\\nReview Comment\\\\nPARTICIPANT SETUP\\\\nSign In\\\\nStart Participant\\\\nResume Session\\\\nRefresh Runtime Reads\\\\nRUN LIFECYCLE\\\\nSave Paused\\\\nSave Running\\\\nResume Run\\\\nComplete Run\\\\nMONITOR CONTROL\\\\nMonitor Pause\\\\nMonitor Resume\\\\nMonitor Go To Unit\\\\nMonitor Lock Test\\\\nMonitor Unlock Test\\\\nMonitor Unlock Navigation\\\\nMonitor Lock Navigation\\\\nMonitor Set Testlet Time\\\\nMonitor Complete\\\\nMonitor Open Runs\\\\nExport Open Runs CSV\\\\nREVIEW AND EXPORT\\\\nDetailed Responses\\\\nLoad Result Groups\\\\nCreate Review\\\\nUpdate Review\\\\nDelete Review\\\\nLoad Reviews\\\\nDelete Group Results\\\\nExport Responses CSV\\\\nExport Review CSV\\\\nRuntime Snapshot\\\\n\\\\nSee the current participant state at a glance before diving into the detailed runtime payloads.\\\\n\\\\nOPERATIONAL SUMMARY\\\\nAT A GLANCE\\\\nSESSION\\\\nin_progress\\\\n\\\\nold-login · 689f3dee-ea38-4080-abb5-4edf84391678\\\\n\\\\nRUN\\\\nrunning\\\\n\\\\nf4d31a1c-3789-404b-b84c-1a68ac829828\\\\n\\\\nCURRENT UNIT\\\\nEntry unit\\\\n\\\\nNext action: resume\\\\n\\\\nOPEN RUNS\\\\n1\\\\n\\\\nActivat\\\"}\\n❌ Automation error: page