\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:63368/participant?participantSessionId=47b2393a-b71b-4817-a792-e618d1995195\u0026testRunId=e365c8fb-0c61-4f22-83da-5870f23c94a3\u0026tenantKey=demo-tenant\u0026workspaceKey=entry-target\u0026loginKey=new-login\u0026groupKey=entry-group\u0026bookletKey=entry-booklet\\\"}]\\ngenerated_entry_and_operator_link=rewrite: correct authenticated session/run and exact re-entry link\\nold_participant=original:c616bf5e-e564-4976-a7d8-317e7522f14b\\noperator_entry_links=[{\\\"href\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:63368/participant?participantSessionId=47b2393a-b71b-4817-a792-e618d1995195\u0026testRunId=e365c8fb-0c61-4f22-83da-5870f23c94a3\u0026tenantKey=demo-tenant\u0026workspaceKey=entry-target\u0026loginKey=new-login\u0026groupKey=entry-group\u0026bookletKey=entry-booklet\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"http://127.0.0.1:63368/participant?participantSessionId=47b2393a-b71b-4817-a792-e618d1995195\u0026testRunId=e365c8fb-0c61-4f22-83da-5870f23c94a3\u0026tenantKey=demo-tenant\u0026workspaceKey=entry-target\u0026loginKey=new-login\u0026groupKey=entry-group\u0026bookletKey=entry-booklet\\\"}]\\ngenerated_entry_and_operator_link=original: correct authenticated session/run and exact re-entry link\\nui_smoke_step=participant-original-aspect-player\\nui_smoke_step=participant-original-sample-package\\nui_smoke_step=participant-original-booklet-config\\nui_smoke_step=optional-original-player-navigation\\nui_smoke_step=optional-original-player-surface\\nui_smoke_step=participant-original-test-controller\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"994e51\",\"wall_time_seconds\":5.001759583,\"session_id\":65886,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"b49835\",\"wall_time_seconds\":2.166165208,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":21,\"output\":\"{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"failure\\\",\\\"failed\\\":14,\\\"passed\\\":21,\\\"pending\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb60ea8481919dde77a46b6c8eab","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"Die Zusatzprüfung besteht jetzt in beiden Oberflächen: Der generierte Einstieg startet den richtigen Teilnehmer, der Operator-Link enthält exakt dieselbe Session- und Run-ID, und die vorherige Antwort bleibt erhalten. Die alte Push-CI ist mit 21 erfolgreichen und 14 fehlgeschlagenen Jobs beendet — alle 14 scheitern am korrigierten Linkvergleich. Ich committe diesen abgesicherten Schritt mit einem frischen Entire-Checkpoint.\n","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":323},"id":"msg_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb78e1bc819192da5e47e2bfd2ce","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1791355742.968254,"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_lCQFOVq2xwEwMIsKpWwMmzXa","id":"ctc_06ef5e23f2db4ce4016ac5eb7b7d7881918d4047f5641e2ef9","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\\n@@\\n-fourteen later push-CI jobs fail at the same operator session-card assertion\\n+its completed push CI has 21 successful and fourteen failed jobs. All fourteen\\n+fail at the same operator session-card assertion\\n@@\\n That failed attempt is retained and is not application-regression evidence.\\n+A focused protected SQLite/headful check then passes the actual operator\\n+handoff in both interfaces: load the saved roster, generate its links, use the\\n+new login's link, open its real popup, compare the authenticated scope/Run and\\n+refresh the operator session card. Both surfaces expose the same exact\\n+Run-bound re-entry URL and retain the older Run's exact answer and status.\\n Evidence is retained in ignored `.data/entry-link-scope-20261007.*`.\\n*** Update File: /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\n@@\\n close any full rendered-UI acceptance row or pixel-identity claim.\\n+\\n+The 2026-10-07 operator handoff check also passes in both interface modes on\\n+owned protected SQLite/headful Chrome: a generated entry starts the requested\\n+login and its exact authenticated Run, and the refreshed operator card exposes\\n+the same Run-bound re-entry URL. The older participant's response and Run status\\n+remain unchanged. Shared browser gates now check that durable identity instead\\n+of racing login inputs removed after success, and retain the same full-height\\n+Player invariant after layout settling. This closes no full UI row. The separate\\n+immutable Memory/headful Chrome ItemBuilder blank-frame failure remains open;\\n+see `PARITY.md` for the retained evidence and publication boundaries.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cp /tmp/testcenter-entry-link-generated-browser-fifth-20261007.log /tmp/playwright-test-entry-target.js .data/entry-link-scope-20261007.yQtOOZ/\\ngit diff --check\\ngit diff --stat\\nnode --check scripts/smoke-ui.mjs\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app\",max_output_tokens:1500}));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:32841,chars:\"\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git add rewrite-app/scripts/smoke-ui.mjs rewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md rewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\\ngit commit -m \\\"Verify generated participant entry and run-bound session links\\\"\",workdir:\"/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:2000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1791355742.968254,"turn_id":"01a11505-6069-7411-b5ab-e7c10a97a630"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_lCQFOVq2xwEwMIsKpWwM