al/CDK `20.2.14` is compatible; bundle-budget-safe icons use inline SVG projected with `matButtonIcon`, not `MatIconModule`. [Task 2]\n- Build with `npm run build:web`; focused smoke is `UI_SMOKE_BROWSER_CHANNEL=chrome FIRST_SLICE_STORE=memory UI_SMOKE_SKIP_OFFLINE_APP_SHELL=true UI_SMOKE_STOP_AFTER_STEP=participant-entry-sign-in node scripts/smoke-ui.mjs`. The local build passed at 465.90 kB (warning budget exceeded but below 470 kB error); commit `709f9ba` and Entire checkpoint `01M2A1XZJ2DAEA6XQ8S468JQWR` are historical. [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- A Playwright `ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED` at port 4311 means the built API was not running, not an app regression -> verify `/readyz`, start the API, or use the smoke harness. Partial successful CI jobs do not prove final CI; observed run `34675530370` was still in progress. [Task 2]\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"# Task Group: Testcenter Rewrite participant Review CSV parity and optional Original login\n\nscope: Continue Original-compatible participant Review CSV work and reversible Original login parity without overstating incomplete vertical slices or full UI parity.\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app; reuse_rule=reuse source paths and local build/smoke guidance in this checkout; current branch, CI, protected artifact, and parity status need fresh verification.\n\n## Task 1: Participant-isolated “Reviews downloaden” CSV parity\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T17-47-44-rcM2-participant_run_selection_and_live_update_isolation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T19-47-44-01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.jsonl, updated_at=2026-10-05T07:51:13+00:00, thread_id=01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a, partial; participant export unfinished)\n\n### keywords\n\n- participant-review-csv, GET /reviews/export, Reviews d