ntent, participant delivery, monitoring, results, and operational diagnostics from the protected Angular console.\\\\n\\\\nStorage\\\\nsqlite\\\\nSchema\\\\n58\\\\nAuth\\\\nrequired\\\\nPort\\\\n4310\\\\nRoutes\\\\n138\\\\nBuild\\\\nlocal\\\\nShells\\\\n7\\\\nView\\\\ncontent\\\\nReadiness\\\\nready\\\\nRaw Debug\\\\nShow\\\\nStart\\\\nWorkspace\\\\nContent\\\\nRuntime\\\\nParticipant\\\\nSystem Check\\\\nDiagnostics\\\\nAccount · demo-admin\\\\nChange password\\\\nSign out\\\\nLIVE CONTEXT\\\\nCurrent Scope And Working Ids\\\\n\\\\nThe frontend now keeps the latest workspace, content, and runtime ids visible, so you do not have to fish them out of the raw response pane.\\\\n\\\\nWORKSPACE SCOPE\\\\nTenant\\\\ndemo-tenant\\\\nWorkspace\\\\nentry-target\\\\nCONTENT INTAKE\\\\nSource Package\\\\nf9153665-7dc5-4e06-803a-fd6e98710237\\\\nImport Job\\\\n7988a385-604b-4db7-951a-b192605f5cb5\\\\nRelease\\\\nd3e3d07e-36ec-4796-8149-be4af473efa6\\\\nPARTICIPANT RUNTIME\\\\nParticipant\\\\nnew-login\\\\nSession\\\\n56c85fba-61db-4d9c-8a9f-764d28ac2557\\\\nRun\\\\nd74b499f-0c10-4478-8b2b-3ee62dd9ca87\\\\nUnit\\\\nentry-unit\\\\nADMIN ACCESS\\\\nAdmin\\\\ndemo-admin\\\\nSession\\\\nsigned in\\\\nContent Intake\\\\nSource File Name\\\\nMedia Type\\\\nLoad Source Document File\\\\nSource Document\\\\nSource Package Id\\\\nContent Release Id\\\\nImport Job Id\\\\nForce Activation\\\\nOverride open-run guard for activation\\\\nCreate Source Package\\\\nCreate Import Job\\\\nActivate Release\\\\nRefresh Content Reads\\\\nRestore Demo Source\\\\nDraft Source Document Preview\\\\n\\\\nQuick validation of the file currently staged for source-package intake.\\\\n\\\\n1 VISIBLE RECORD\\\\nfrontend-starter.xml\\\\n\\\\nXML source document\\\\n\\\\n226 chars\\\\n1 line(s)\\\\n1 inferred booklet(s)\\\\nMEDIA TYPE\\\\napplication/xml\\\\nSTATUS\\\\nDraft\\\\nPREVIEW\\\\n<assessment><booklet key=\\\\\\\"booklet:starter\\\\\\\" label=\\\\\\\"Starter\\\\\\\"><unit key=\\\\\\\"unit-1\\\\\\\" label=\\\\\\\"Entry\\\\\\\" /><unit key=\\\\\\\"unit-participant-route\\\\\\\" label=\\\\\\\"Participant Route\\\\\\\" /><unit key=\\\\\\\"unit-paus...\\\\nContent Snapshot\\\\n\\\\nKeep the latest package, import, release, and activation-guard state visible while you work through intake and rollout.\\\\n\\\\nOPERATIONAL SUMMARY\\\\nAT A GLANCE\\\\nSOURCE PACKAGE\\\\nentry.json\\\\n\\\\nf9153665-7dc5-4e06-803a-fd6e98710237\\\\n\\\\nIMPORT JOB\\\\ncompleted\\\\n\\\\n7988a385-604b-4db7-951a-b192605f5cb5\\\\n\\\\nRELEASE\\\\nactive\\\\n\\\\nd3e3d07e-36ec-4796-8149-be4af473efa6\\\\n\\\\nACTIVATION GUARD\\\\nclear\\\\n\\\\nNo open-run blocker detected.\\\\n\\\\nContent Read Filters\\\\n\\\\nNarrow operator reads across source packages, import jobs, and releases before refreshing the content snapshot.\\\\n\\\\nSource Package Status\\\\nAll package statuses\\\\nuploaded\\\\naccepted\\\\nrejected\\\\nWorkspace File Type\\\\nAll file types\\\\nTesttakers\\\\nBooklet\\\\nSysCheck\\\\nUnit\\\\nResource\\\\nPackage\\\\nSource Package Media Type\\\\nSource Package File Name\\\\nLatest Import Status\\\\nAll latest import statuses\\\\nqueued\\\\nrunning\\\\nfailed\\\\ncompleted\\\\nWorkspace File Sort\\\\nFile name\\\\nStored size\\\\nUpload time\\\\nWorkspace File Sort Direction\\\\nAscending\\\\nDescending\\\\nSource Package Limit\\\\nImport Job Status\\\\nAll import statuses\\\\nqueued\\\\nrunning\\\\nfailed\\\\ncompleted\\\\nImport Job S\\\"}\\n❌ Automation error: locator.waitFor: Timeout 30000ms exceeded.\\nCall log:\\n\\u001b[2m  - waiting for locator('article.card').filter({ has: getByRole('heading', { name: 'Release Test Runs', exact: true }) }).locator('.record-card').filter({ hasText: 'new-login' }).getByRole('link', { name: 'Participant Link: http://127.0.0.1:64916/participant?participantSessionId=56c85fba-61db-4d9c-8a9f-764d28ac2557&testRunId=d74b499f-0c10-4478-8b2b-3ee62dd9ca87&tenantKey=demo-tenant&workspaceKey=entry-target&loginKey=new-login&groupKey=entry-group&bookle