SHELL=true UI_SMOKE_STOP_AFTER_STEP=participant-entry-sign-in node scripts/smoke-ui.mjs`. The local build passed at 465.90 kB (warning budget exceeded but below 470 kB error); commit `709f9ba` and Entire checkpoint `01M2A1XZJ2DAEA6XQ8S468JQWR` are historical. [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- A Playwright `ERR_CONNECTION_REFUSED` at port 4311 means the built API was not running, not an app regression -> verify `/readyz`, start the API, or use the smoke harness. Partial successful CI jobs do not prove final CI; observed run `34675530370` was still in progress. [Task 2]\n- Full Original parity remains open across starter/player/workspace/results/system-check/admin, themes, and equal-viewport screenshot comparisons. Do not call this committed login slice full parity. [Task 2]\n\n# Task Group: Kodierbox read-only VERA pilot-workspace transfer planning\n\nscope: Compare the VERA pilot workspaces and plan a constrained test-to-production replacement without touching unrelated production workspaces or performing mutations.\napplies_to: cwd=/Users/julian/dev/iqb/Kodierbox; reuse_rule=use only for read-only reconnaissance until separately authorized maintenance specifies backups, scope, and writes.\n\n## Task 1: Compare production and test pilot workspaces\nrewrite-spike/README.md\nrewrite-app/README.md\nrewrite-app/apps/web/src/assets/ORIGINAL-UI-LICENSE.txt\nrewrite-app/docs/PARITY.md\nrewrite-app/docs/ORIGINAL-UI-PARITY.md\nREADME.md\nrewrite-app/test-fixtures/original-testcenter/README.md\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n## Task 1: Participant-isolated “Reviews downloaden” CSV parity\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-07T17-47-44-rcM2-participant_run_selection_and_live_update_isolation.md (cwd=/Users/julian/Documents/Codex/2026-08-13/arbeite-im-repo-users-julian-code, rollout_path=/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T