 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session attach <session-id> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -a, --agent string     Agent that created the session (see 'entire agent list' for registered agents, including external) (default \"claude-code\")\n  -f, --force            Skip confirmation and amend the last commit with the checkpoint trailer (best-effort; if the amend fails the checkpoint is still created and the trailer is printed for manual paste)\n  -h, --help             help for attach\n      --review           Tag the attached session as an agent review\n      --skills strings   Optional: declare which review skills were run in this session. Only used with --review\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --context name   Act as this saved login name for this command only, instead of the active context (entire auth contexts lists them)\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a\",\n  \"cli_version\": \"0.10.3\",\n  \"base_commit\": \"c929ec996c806f6f43e1d0a90aa7491c5dec6b1c\",\n  \"attribution_base_commit\": \"c929ec996c806f6f43e1d0a90aa7491c5dec6b1c\",\n  \"started_at\": \"2026-10-05T07:55:31.324705+02:00\",\n  \"phase\": \"ended\",\n  \"last_interaction_time\": \"2026-10-07T09:09:57.513037+02:00\",\n  \"checkpoint_count\": 0,\n  \"last_checkpoint_id\": \"01M4AK2NHY8BVE4EDW2FV39AN7\",\n  \"attached_manually\": true,\n  \"agent_type\": \"Codex\",\n  \"token_usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 10744101,\n    \"cache_creation_tokens\": 0,\n    \"cache_read_tokens\": 376396672,\n    \"output_tokens\": 1845475,\n    \"api_call_count\": 15979\n  },\n  \"session_turn_count\": 184,\n  \"transcript_path\": \"/Users/julian/.codex/sessions/2026/09/07/rollout-2026-09-07T19-47-44-01a07cfb-af30-7a62-8a81-f821103d611a.jsonl\",\n  \"last_prompt\": \"Arbeite im Repo /Users/julian/code/testcenter-rewrite/rewrite-app autonom weiter.\\n\\nZiel: Testcenter-Rewrite als lauffähige, produktionsnahe Anwendung mit möglichst hoher Parität zum ursprünglichen Testcenter fertigstellen.\\n\\nLies zuerst docs/PARITY.md, README.md, git status und die letzten 15 Commits.\\nSetze anschließend immer den nächsten sinnvollsten Implementierungsschritt um.\\n\\nAktueller nächster Kandidat:\\nPrüfe und implementiere den teilnehmerisolierten Review-CSV-Download auf der Participant-Starterseite entsprechend dem Original-Ablauf „Reviews downloaden“. Review-Erfassung und Admin-Export existieren bereits.\\n\\nBewahre die ungetrackte Datei docs/testcenter-thread-migration-process.pptx unverändert.\\nCommitte sinnvolle abgeschlossene Schritte. Nicht pushen, bis ich darum bitte.\\nFrage nicht nach „weiter?“.\"\n}\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"/Users/julian/.zprofile:source:8: no such file or directory: /Users/julian/.bashrc\n# tests 165\n# pass 165\n# fail 0\n# tests 42\n# pass 42\n# fail 0\n# tests 108\n# pass 108\n# fail 0\nsed: .gitignore: No such file or directory\nAttach an existing agent session that wasn't captured by hooks.\n\nThis creates a checkpoint from the session's transcript and links it to the\nlast commit. Use this when hooks failed to fire or weren't installed when\nthe session started, or to attach a research session.\n\nIf the last commit already has a checkpoint, the session is added to it.\nOtherwise a new checkpoint is created.\n\nUse --review to tag the attached session as an agent review. The\nfirst user prompt in the transcript is recorded as the review prompt.\nPass --skills to declare which skills were actually run; omit to\nattach a review without a declared skills list.\n\nWorks with any registered agent, including external agents enabled via\nexternal_agents in settings. Run 'entire agent list' to see the full list.\n\nIf --agent doesn't locate a transcript, Entire auto-detects the agent from\nthe transcript and prints the detected agent name.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session attach <session-id> 